 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e8f3b55c-3e38-4b44-b400-709129522db3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In the forms with an element, ",
 StyleBox["e", "TI"],
 " is a linear combination of basis elements of the complex, and anything \
else returns unevaluated."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"edc5c505-e5f6-4748-984f-e2e45c83294d"],

